  "$comment": "Single source of truth for the FCV-401 digital twin: KSB BOA-CVE IMS DN 100 control valve with EA-C 40 electric actuator on the chilled-water side of a district-cooling energy transfer station. Valve and actuator data from KSB type series booklet 7520.1/23-EN.",
